{"ID":"20240513083128-ci0uecu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083128-ci0uecu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083128-ci0uecu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160359-d6d8gsa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160359-d6d8gsa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160359-d6d8gsa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:517,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:517\u0026#125;","title":"206","type":"doc","updated":"20240514151336"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513160359-d6d8gsa","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 942px;","id":"20240513160359-d6d8gsa","updated":"20240514151336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：05/05/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"166-3 C, YC"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"38/微胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22/05/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：右肋偶有不適感。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 寒熱：額涼，手還是稍微涼點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 睡眠：睡眠很深，前幾天有昏沉感，今天好多了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 二便：己椒歷黃丸服後有排大便二次，第二次是下利，但不是水泄，腸鳴沒有了，大便一日一行，有排氣但很少，小便還是中黃有泡沫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 飲食：胃口好，味覺敏感，東西都很好吃，口渴還好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 胸脅：脇肋比較沒有苦滿的感覺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 其它：嘴唇沒有那麼乾，感覺不太出來，眼乾喉乾已沒有那種感覺，体重增加。在廁所人多或飛行工具上，小便會緊張到小不出來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡白紅。2、耳診： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五苓散。40粒，搭飛機前服8粒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同五月十三日方，參付，九碗水煮三碗，早晚飯前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 我們在清腸胃的時候，當裡面沒有宿便的時候，食物會變的非常好吃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 五苓散過去我們用在二三個月長程的旅行，怕得到溫疫，吃壞肚子，吃到不乾淨的食物或水，用五苓散把這些不乾淨的東西從小便排掉，所以在溫疫上用的很多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 脈緩有力這是屬於夏天和長夏中間的脈。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 清肝方面讓柴胡、黃芩、鬱金、龍膽草，讓你大便好，而我們眼睛乾是肝臟的津液不夠，喉嚨乾是腎裡面的津液不夠，口唇乾是脾內的津液不夠，舌頭乾是心內的津液不夠，所以裡面有很多滋陰的藥在裡面，平常我很少開滋陰的藥在裡面，但你這種狀況是陰虛，而木要疏，所以開疏肝的藥還有補陽的藥，像巴戟天，像嘴唇乾喉嚨乾眼睛乾的現象改善了，表示津液補進去了，補進去後我們要固陽，陽守住，津液就不易流失掉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}